      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "MathUtils, TypeConversionUtils and ValidationUtils results; the blue line is recomputed every frame."
        - "MeshUtils builds a circle (makeCircle2DMesh, blue) and two line strips (makeLineStrip2DMeshWithJoints, orange and green) at runtime. Every corner of the strips should be round."
        - "AnimationUtils: the top disc slides (makeTween with MathUtils.easeOutElastic), the left one pulses (animateVisualFeedback), the right one scales (pingPong)."
        - 'SceneObjectUtils and ComponentUtils search a small rig built at runtime; Logger writes the same results to the Lens logs (the "UtilitiesDemo" lines).'
